{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":36,"timestamp":"2026-07-14T03:48:31.325315780Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"174fac6e-51ed-4d70-8233-8739a5570b6d","title":"Legal/licensing assessment for execution-engine candidates","description":"Question: \n\nContext: \n\nFindings: \n\nGPLv3 (Neo4j Community), BSL (Memgraph), MPL-2.0 (JointJS), and source-available (Camunda/Zeebe) licensing each carry distinct implications for EDASES distribution and embedding. Multiple research reports flag this as a question for legal review, not a technical finding. Source: synthesis/execution-engine-ui-synthesis.md Deferred Item 1.","priority":"low","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQE5I2kp/SnEkinHdvUUemI5vBL30M2YnPfuxTTYlRHPzZgdreb/neYefm5qt4Ihan4y+3zLzORb+pL1vgCY8WQA="}
