{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":58,"timestamp":"2026-07-14T04:39:46.217788109Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"1998b676-04c9-490c-8ec9-15de90b0be76","title":"TDD BYPASS test suite for signing enforcement (Phase 0)","description":"## Phase 0 — BYPASS Test Suite\n\nWrite ~15 TDD test scenarios asserting current audit-mode behaviour (unsigned commits accepted, no enforcement failure). These tests become the regression baseline for Phase 1 enforcement wiring.\n\n## Test scenarios (from evidence-based-gates.md §5.1)\n\n- BYPASS-01: sync accepts unsigned hub commits in audit mode\n- BYPASS-02: sync accepts unsigned lock commits in audit mode\n- BYPASS-03: kickoff accepts unsigned agent commits in audit mode\n- BYPASS-04: swarm accepts unsigned agent commits in audit mode\n- BYPASS-05: trust approve works without driver key present\n- BYPASS-06: bootstrap.status pending allows unsigned commits\n- BYPASS-07: bootstrap.status complete allows unsigned commits (audit mode)\n- BYPASS-08: signing_enforcement=disabled accepts everything\n- BYPASS-09: dry-run mode reports violations without rejecting\n- BYPASS-10: driver key absence is not an error in audit mode\n- BYPASS-11+: additional edge cases from sync event-replay paths\n\n## Depends on\n- Nothing (this is the first phase)\n\n## Enables\n- Issue #22 (enforcement wiring) — tests must pass before wiring begins\n- Issue #23 (event-sig verification) — tests validate current behaviour\n\n## Source\nto-file/crosslink-gates/gates-issues.md Phase 0\nevidence-based-gates.md §5.1 BYPASS scenarios","priority":"medium","created_by":"OL2r"},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGcU75LkLe0VoBSmIqeJYA4U6ighnQo3cCwyxIzo+sZhl2HWCZISYiR94AeKh4pIZ1JI2dDBy6BvHKB5uBdd9Ak="}
