{"agent_id":"OL2r","agent_seq":269,"timestamp":"2026-07-31T17:00:57.564720434Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"0b19aeb2-16ae-4502-a9a8-61e31d2c0c33","comment_uuid":"73369e3e-c1dd-44ed-b4ef-1db4f485e52e","author":"OL2r","content":"The 7 free Zen models (opencode/big-pickle, opencode/deepseek-v4-flash-free, opencode/laguna-s-2.1-free, opencode/ling-3.0-flash-free, opencode/mimo-v2.5-free, opencode/nemotron-3-ultra-free, opencode/north-mini-code-free) are absent from the /models picker.\n\nRoot cause: the custom plugin ~/.config/opencode/plugins/dynamic-models.ts (and duplicate plugin.ts) adds 'opencode' to disabled_providers AND wipes provider.opencode.models = {} via the hideProviders loop. This removes the entire Zen provider from /models.\n\nEvidence:\n- `opencode models opencode` -> Error: Provider not found: opencode\n- `opencode --pure models opencode` (plugins bypassed) -> lists all 7 free models\n- Resolved config shows opencode in disabled_providers and provider.opencode.models = {}\n- Live API call with the Go key to https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions using deepseek-v4-flash-free returns 200 OK (the Go key DOES authenticate to Zen free models)\n\nOnly the free models are wanted; paid Zen models would fail since no Zen API credits are used.","created_at":"2026-07-31T17:00:57.556727596Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAL0KTvU3aNpfhlR2NqkAxlqX5a4eB+DnfbJd3ki+ZUy/yE3VuMi65FSQ8FtsGyFH92oKd8Y5R8qXDMk9oa5i8Dw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:txtxRbCGncxPs5YVqhd0abUgfcruU3ze6o9USZ9e9ck","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgBrkJWbwQmXES5+ltWRxRKeJmS2PIO3BfyCG5CwZdt0oAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIfh5PVllzMa+krRZWSW7mnNjWefVHOkEE1EIXiHAkDbNqZJAEjFO5+vX9N6ildRz2JDVQ